{
  "uid": "versola-security-dpop-revocation",
  "title": "Versola — DPoP & revocation security signals",
  "description": "Two independent defenses and how often each one actually has to act: DPoP's replay-nonce checks (auth's own assertion path plus edge's nonce ring) and edge's token-revocation cache. Metric names come from auth/src/main/scala/versola/oauth/dpop/EdgeAssertionService.scala, edge/src/main/scala/versola/edge/dpop/DpopMetrics.scala and edge/src/main/scala/versola/edge/revocation/RevocationMetrics.scala. None of these carry a documented SLA yet, so only revocation_cache_reload_failures_total gets a threshold below -- a cache that cannot reload is unconditionally a problem regardless of what a latency budget would say; the rest are plotted without one rather than guessing a number.",
  "tags": [
    "versola",
    "security"
  ],
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timezone": "utc",
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "label": "Data source",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "namespace",
        "label": "Namespace",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "query": "label_values(revocation_cache_entries, namespace)",
        "refresh": 1,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "job",
        "label": "Service",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "query": "label_values(revocation_cache_entries{namespace=\"$namespace\"}, job)",
        "refresh": 1,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "What this board reads",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Two independent defenses and how often each one actually has to act: DPoP's replay-nonce checks (auth's own assertion path plus edge's nonce ring) and edge's token-revocation cache. Metric names come from auth/src/main/scala/versola/oauth/dpop/EdgeAssertionService.scala, edge/src/main/scala/versola/edge/dpop/DpopMetrics.scala and edge/src/main/scala/versola/edge/revocation/RevocationMetrics.scala. None of these carry a documented SLA yet, so only revocation_cache_reload_failures_total gets a threshold below -- a cache that cannot reload is unconditionally a problem regardless of what a latency budget would say; the rest are plotted without one rather than guessing a number."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "auth: DPoP assertion exemptions & rejections",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum (rate(dpop_edge_assertion_exemptions_total{namespace=\"$namespace\", job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "exemptions"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum (rate(dpop_edge_assertion_rejections_total{namespace=\"$namespace\", job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "rejections"
        }
      ],
      "description": "EdgeAssertionService's own two counters, both label-less -- plotted together with the rejection series added as a second target below.",
      "id": 2,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "edge: DPoP nonce ring fallbacks & capacity hits",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum (rate(dpop_shared_ring_fallbacks_total{namespace=\"$namespace\", job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "shared ring fallbacks"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum (rate(dpop_local_ring_capacity_hits_total{namespace=\"$namespace\", job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "local ring capacity hits"
        }
      ],
      "description": "DpopMetrics.scala's shared-ring fallback and local-ring capacity counters, label-less like their auth-side counterparts.",
      "id": 3,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "edge: revocation cache size",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum (revocation_cache_entries{namespace=\"$namespace\", job=~\"$job\"})",
          "legendFormat": "edge: revocation cache size"
        }
      ],
      "description": "RevocationMetrics.scala's own gauge of the cache's current entry count.",
      "id": 4,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 15
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "edge: revocation cache staleness",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum (revocation_cache_staleness_seconds{namespace=\"$namespace\", job=~\"$job\"})",
          "legendFormat": "edge: revocation cache staleness"
        }
      ],
      "description": "How far behind central's own state the cache's last successful reload left it. No threshold set here -- add one once an SLA for acceptable staleness is written down.",
      "id": 5,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 15
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "edge: revocation cache reload failures",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.001
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum (rate(revocation_cache_reload_failures_total{namespace=\"$namespace\", job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "edge: revocation cache reload failures"
        }
      ],
      "description": "A cache that cannot reload is serving revocation decisions off data whose staleness the panel above can no longer be trusted to report. Any nonzero rate here is a real signal.",
      "id": 6,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 23
      }
    }
  ]
}
